    "preamble": "Gujarat Cooperative Milk Marketing ... vs State Of Nct Of Delhi And Anr on 2 April, 2024 Author: C.Hari Shankar Bench: C.Hari Shankar $~60 & 61 * In The High Court Of Delhi At New Delhi + Rsa 50/2021 and Cm 5639/2020 Gujarat Cooperative Milk Marketing Federation And Anr. ..... Appell Through: Mr. J. Amal Anand, Advocate versus State Of Nct Of Delhi And Anr. Through: + Rsa 53/2021 and Cm 9713/2020 Gujarat Co-Operative Milk Marketing Federation Ltd. ..... Appellan Through: Mr. J. Amal Anand, Advocate versus State Of Nct Delhi ..... Respondent Through: Coram: Hon'Ble Mr. Justice C.Hari Shankar Order % 02.04.2024 1.",
    "facts": "",
